<!--
  The three URLs of the map, and nothing else: `?q=` deep links are views of the same page, and
  their canonical folds them back onto their language variant.

  `/map/` picks the language from the browser (the x-default of hreflang); `?lang=en` and
  `?lang=fr` are the two fixed variants. The hreflang set itself lives in the <head> of
  map/index.html — one place, not two to keep in step.

  No <lastmod>: without a build step it would go stale at the first commit that forgets it, and a
  wrong date is worse than none.

  This file is not announced by a robots.txt: crawlers only read the one at the root of the host,
  mrpa2a.github.io/robots.txt, which this repository does not serve. It is submitted by hand in
  Google Search Console and Bing Webmaster Tools.
-->
<urlset xmlns="http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9">
  <url><loc>https://mrpa2a.github.io/rift-transfers/map/</loc></url>
  <url><loc>https://mrpa2a.github.io/rift-transfers/map/?lang=en</loc></url>
  <url><loc>https://mrpa2a.github.io/rift-transfers/map/?lang=fr</loc></url>
</urlset>
